{
  "description": "The proposal is to install 367 DMEGC DM460G12RT-G48HBB solar PV panels with a total generating capacity of 168.82kWp on the South, East & West roofs of the building. 2 x SE66.6K SolarEdge Inverters and 187 x S1000 SolarEdge Optimisers, Enviroguard bird protection.\nThe panels are All Black with black frames and anti-reflective coated glass. They will be mounted flush to the roof on rails, following the roof pitch.\nThe electricity generated will be used on site, with any surplus exported to the grid. The installation will save approximately 30.03 tonnes of CO2 per year which has been calculated on SolarEdge Designer.\nInverters and associated electrical equipment will be located externally to the rear of the building and will be gated.",
